flowchart TD
    A[Qualified property + offer ready] --> B[Retell AI places outbound call]
    B --> C{Call connected?}
    C -- No --> D[Retry logic<br/>up to N attempts]
    D --> B
    C -- Yes --> E[Confirm correct homeowner/property]
    E --> F{Confirmed?}
    F -- No --> G[End call / flag for review]
    F -- Yes --> H[RAG lookup: relevant context<br/>past interactions, property notes]
    H --> I[Discuss situation]
    I --> J[Present generated offer]
    J --> K{Homeowner response}
    K -- Accepted --> L[Schedule appointment with client]
    K -- Rejected --> M[Capture rejection reason]
    L --> N[Generate call transcript]
    M --> N
    N --> O[Analyze transcript]
    O --> P[Store outcome in Supabase]
    P --> Q[Feed transcript + summary into RAG knowledge base]
    Q -.enriches future calls.-> H